ed_at":"2021-06-06T06:02:51.431Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eWe can consider your proposal for \u003ca href=\"https://www.sputnik.fund/#/dao/nft-onboarding.sputnikdao.near/proposals/74\"\u003e10N at the NFT Onboarding DAO\u003c/a\u003e to be the [IDEA] stage for your cartoon.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe next stage would be putting a deck together with the timeline and a rough storyboard for the cartoon, which you can submit for 20N, even after the 6/6 hackathon end date.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":2,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2021-06-06T06:02:51.431Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":1,"reads":22,"readers_count":21,"score":9.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":2733,"topic_slug":"its-a-lot-of-fun-catching-scammers-and-sharing-them-with-the-community","display_username":"Jordan Gray","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://www.sputnik.fund/#/dao/nft-onboarding.sputnikdao.near/proposals/74","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"SputnikDAO","clicks":0},{"url":"http://gov.near.org/t/i-make-cartoon-about-near/2742/2","internal":true,"reflection":true,"title":"I make cartoon about NEAR","clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":211,"hidden":false,"trust_level":3,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/its-a-lot-of-fun-catching-scammers-and-sharing-them-with-the-community/2733/2","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":7404,"name":"Iotachan","username":"iotachan","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/gov.near.org/iotachan/{size}/858_2.png","created_at":"2021-06-06T06:44:11.571Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eThank you for the effort to protect NEAR holder from Scammers. The animation idea also sound great!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHowever I can not vote up for this, for the forum matter. This is not a proper Written Ideation proposal. Since you submit it to the NFT-Onboarding DAO, Please follow the \u003ca href=\"http://gov.near.org/t/guide-createbase-hackathon-nft-onboarding-dao/1215\"\u003eGuild here\u003c/a\u003e,\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOr check some Ideation proposal Reference below:\u003c/p\u003e\u003caside class=\"quote quote-modified\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"2345\"\u003e\n  \u003cdiv class=\"title\"\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"quote-controls\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003cimg loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"http://gov.near.org/user_avatar/gov.near.org/cryptotwilight/48/1848_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"http://gov.near.org/t/presentation-decentralized-defi-merch-d-swipe/2345\"\u003e[DONE] Decentralized DeFi Merch - D Swipe\u003c/a\u003e \u003ca class=\"badge-category__wrapper \" href=\"/c/ecosystem/nft-onboarding/51\"\u003e\u003cspan data-category-id=\"51\" style=\"--category-badge-color: #652D90; --category-badge-text-color: #FFFFFF; --parent-category-badge-color: #BF1E2E;\" data-parent-category-id=\"16\" data-drop-close=\"true\" class=\"badge-category --has-parent\" title=\"NFT Onboarding SputnikDAO aka NFT Social Club. More info on how to submit a proposal! Council: @starpause, @whatshertoes, @iotachan.\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"badge-category__name\"\u003eNFT Onboarding\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\n  \u003c/div\u003e\n  \u003cblockquote\u003e\n    [IDEATION] \nThe challenge \nAt the time of writing decentralized commerce experience in Web 3 wasn’t as good as that of Web 2. Users have to step through several complicated processes in order to buy stuff and developers have to go through quite a bit of pain in order to sell their real world products. \nThe Idea \nThe idea is to create a NEAR blockchain based store that sells one of a kind T-shirts that are tagged with an NFT basically and NFT-shirt. The store would be totally decentralized for bo…\n  \u003c/blockquote\u003e\n\u003c/aside\u003e\n\u003caside class=\"quote quote-modified\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"2511\"\u003e\n  \u003cdiv class=\"title\"\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"quote-controls\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003cimg loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"http://gov.near.org/user_avatar/gov.near.org/bianca/48/1868_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"http://gov.near.org/t/hackathon-marma-j-foundation-nft-onboarding-dao/2511\"\u003e[HACKATHON]: Marma J Foundation: NFT-Onboarding DAO\u003c/a\u003e \u003ca class=\"badge-category__wrapper \" href=\"/c/ecosystem/nft-onboarding/51\"\u003e\u003cspan data-category-id=\"51\" style=\"--category-badge-color: #652D90; --category-badge-text-color: #FFFFFF; --parent-category-badge-color: #BF1E2E;\" data-parent-category-id=\"16\" data-drop-close=\"true\" class=\"badge-category --has-parent\" title=\"NFT Onboarding SputnikDAO aka NFT Social Club. More info on how to submit a proposal! Council: @starpause, @whatshertoes, @iotachan.\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"badge-category__name\"\u003eNFT Onboarding\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\n  \u003c/div\u003e\n  \u003cblockquote\u003e\n    [IDEATION]: Marma J Foundation: NFT-Onboarding DAO \nSubmission by: bianca.near \nTarget: marmaj.sputnikdao.near \nThe Marma J DAO exists with the purpose of supporting creatives who aim to spread love and positivity throughout the web3 community. Currently, the \u003ca href=\"https://sputnik.fund/#/marmaj.sputnikdao.near\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003eMarma J SputnikDAO\u003c/a\u003e is where the Marma J Council Members vote on proposals submitted on the NEAR blockchain. Each proposal to the Marma J SputnikDAO also requires a \u003ca href=\"http://gov.near.org/\"\u003eDiscourse Forum\u003c/a\u003e link upon submission. \nOne of the main funding avenues plann…\n  \u003c/blockquote\u003e\n\u003c/aside\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eI voted you up for the \u003ca href=\"http://gov.near.org/t/i-found-a-significant-bug-in-sputnik-fund/2735\"\u003ethis one\u003c/a\u003e \u003cimg src=\"http://gov.near.org/images/emoji/twitter/blush.png?v=12\" title=\":blush:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":blush:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e, the BUG proposal you submitted.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThanks for engaging with us in so many ways! Looking forward to see development of the carton.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":3,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2021-06-06T06:44:11.571Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":1,"reads":20,"readers_count":19,"score":44.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":2733,"topic_slug":"its-a-lot-of-fun-catching-scammers-and-sharing-them-with-the-community","display_username":"Iotachan","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"http://gov.near.org/t/done-decentralized-defi-merch-d-swipe/2345","internal":true,"reflection":false,"title":"[DONE] Decentralized DeFi Merch - D Swipe","clicks":0},{"url":"http://gov.near.org/t/i-found-a-significant-bug-in-sputnik-fund/2735","internal":true,"reflection":false,"title":"I found a significant bug in sputnik.fund","clicks":0},{"url":"http://gov.near.org/t/guide-createbase-hackathon-nft-onboarding-dao/1215","internal":true,"reflection":false,"title":"[Guide] Createbase Hackathon - NFT Onboarding DAO","clicks":0},{"url":"http://gov.near.org/t/hackathon-marma-